                                                "sense_id": "d2b06a39-4e34-3d02-bd91-821e1456ec1d",
                                                "text": "Does biohacking actually alter your biology? Yes and no."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7adbd008-aec7-4037-9b5e-b48766328a2c",
                                                "sense_id": "d2b06a39-4e34-3d02-bd91-821e1456ec1d",
                                                "text": "Biohacking is a very broad concept. It ranges from people that drink bulletproof coffee or people that have chips implanted in their body, to people that use at-home DNA analysis kits. Biohackers often associate themselves with biopunk, transhumanism or techno-progressivism."
                                            }
